{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Akkers van Margraten, Verenigde Staten, interview 35"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:41797"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Ruim Kader Films"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Regionaal Historisch Centrum Limburg ©"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"EJ  Jansen"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Geïnterviewde dient in de 603e Quarter Master Graves Registration Company. Na de landing in Normandië is geïnterviewde betrokken bij het opzetten van begraafplaatsen in Blosville, Saint-Mere-Eglise, Henri Chapelle en krijgt in juni 1945 de opdracht om op de begraafplaats in Margraten alle niet geïdentificeerde soldaten te laten opgraven om te proberen alsnog hun identiteit vast te stellen. Dat was een grote opdracht die tot september 1945 duurt. Hij blijft tot 1953 werkzaam bij de gravendienst.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>interview in het Engels | transcriptie in het Engels| samenvatting in het Nederlands |<br>overeenkomsten met i